===Etymology 1===
From {{m|nn|Satan}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|Satān}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|Σατάν}}, from {{etyl|he|en}} {{m|he|שָׂטָן||adversary, accuser|tr=Sātān|sc=Hebr}}.

